From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000010 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guard Hero <build@guardhero.app>
Date: Mon, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] eagleeye: add EagleEyeInterceptor class declaration

Adds EagleEyeInterceptor class to chrome/browser/guardhero/.
This is the main Chromium integration point for the EagleEye native
blocking engine. Implements net::URLRequestInterceptor.

Chromium files touched:
  chrome/browser/guardhero/eagleeye_interceptor.h (new)
  chrome/browser/guardhero/eagleeye_interceptor.cc (new)
  chrome/browser/guardhero/BUILD.gn (new)
---
 chrome/browser/guardhero/eagleeye_interceptor.h  | 52 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 chrome/browser/guardhero/eagleeye_interceptor.cc | 68 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 120 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 chrome/browser/guardhero/eagleeye_interceptor.h
 create mode 100644 chrome/browser/guardhero/eagleeye_interceptor.cc

diff --git a/chrome/browser/guardhero/eagleeye_interceptor.h b/chrome/browser/guardhero/eagleeye_interceptor.h
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..aabbccdd1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/chrome/browser/guardhero/eagleeye_interceptor.h
@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@
